{"ref":"BDB, רֹ֫קַח","hw":"רֹ֫קַח","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רֹ֫קַח</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>spice-mixture, perfume</strong>;—of holy oil, <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ מִרְקַחַת מַעֲשֵׂה רֹקֵחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:25\" href=\"/Exodus.30.25\">Ex 30:25</a>; of incense, <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ מַעֲשֵׂה רוֹקֵחַ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:35\" href=\"/Exodus.30.35\">35</a>.","next":"BDB, רַקָּח","prev":"BDB, רֶ֫קַח"}